# i18n

- Locales: `bs` (default), `hr`, `sr` (Serbian Latin), `en`.
- Route under `[locale]` (`/bs/...`, `/hr/...`, `/sr/...`, `/en/...`); do not hardcode locale-less user-facing strings in UI.
- **Content strategy B (D37):** `hr`/`sr` load the `bs` message catalog via `catalogLocale()` in `i18n/catalog.ts` + `i18n/request.ts`. Do **not** maintain parallel full catalogs until dedicated translations ship.
- English stays a separate catalog (`messages/en.json`).
- Balkan marketing pathnames (`/cijene`, `/funkcije`, `/kontakt`, …) are shared by `bs`/`hr`/`sr` in `i18n/routing.ts`.
- Put copy in message catalogs; when adding UI text, update `bs` + `en` (hr/sr inherit bs until real translations).
- Locale switcher labels live under `Locale.*` (not hardcoded in components).
- Dates/times: respect clinic timezone (default `Europe/Sarajevo`).
- Phone inputs: default country `+387` unless clinic setting overrides.

